            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention relates to a composition for use in a method of treating a bacterial infection selected from a bacterial urinary tract infection, a bacterial respiratory tract infection, a bacterial soft tissue infection and a bacterial bone infection in a patient, the composition comprising ribose and the amino acids glycine, alanine and glutamine in aqueous solution, the method comprising orally administering the composition to the patient additionally treated with an antibiotic.</p>
